  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F.",
    "Heat olive oil in a 9x9-inch baking dish over medium heat and sauté garlic until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Stir in chicken broth, Dijon mustard, lemon zest, and lemon juice, then bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the chopped lettuce and cook until just wilted, about 3 minutes, then season with salt and pepper.",
    "Pour the mixture over the lettuce, ensuring even coverage, then top with shredded Gruyère and grated Parmesan.",
    "Dot the top with small pieces of butter to melt into the casserole.",
    "Bake uncovered for 12-15 minutes or until the cheeses are golden and bubbly.",
    "Remove from oven, let rest 5 minutes, then serve warm."
  ],
